:: d3 [d3 mooberry-farm map]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Check the long grass.->d3: long grass]]</li>
      <li>[[Approach the scientist->d3: scientist]]</li>
      <li>[[Check out the well.->d3: well]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'd3'>><<e>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'd3'>>
</div>

:: d3: long grass [d3 mooberry-farm long-grass stray]
<p>The noises you heard before are even louder now. You can tell this long grass is full of Mergimals. You just need to see which ones you can find!</p>
<p style='font-weight: bold;'>Roll 1d20</p>
<p>If you got...</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>
    <<link '1-12 (common)' 'stray encounter'>>
      <<set $mergimalEncountered = $mergimals[$encounterTable[$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition].common]>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>
    <<link '1-17 (uncommon)' 'stray encounter'>>
      <<set $mergimalEncountered = $mergimals[$encounterTable[$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition].uncommon]>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>
    <<link '1-20 (rare)' 'stray encounter'>>
      <<set $mergimalEncountered = $mergimals[$encounterTable[$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition].rare]>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>

:: d3: scientist [d3 mooberry-farm scientist]
<p>There's a scientist here for some reason!</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>